WEBVTT

00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:16,060
When my doctor ran blood work, he said that I have low thyroid because my TSH was slightly elevated.

00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:20,700
Should I increase my thyroid medication based upon that?

00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:24,260
No. No, you shouldn't.

00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:28,260
So

00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:32,140
I see this a lot. A person gets a blood test

00:00:32,860 --> 00:00:40,140
from their practitioner and they run a thyroid test, and they will they tell the person

00:00:40,140 --> 00:00:46,220
that they read a thyroid test, and all they read is a TSH. So understand, TSH is thyroid

00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:52,780
stimulating hormone. It's not secreted by your thyroid. It's secreted by your pituitary.

00:00:54,460 --> 00:01:00,700
Because your hypothalamus senses your level of thyroid hormone in the blood. What is that?

00:01:01,340 --> 00:01:07,260
Well, you have free T3, which is the active thyroid hormone in the blood.

00:01:08,140 --> 00:01:15,980
And that's what's sensed. If it is low, it will tell the pituitary to secret thyroid

00:01:15,980 --> 00:01:22,940
stimulated hormone to get your thyroid to stimulate to stimulate more hormone. Your thyroid

00:01:22,940 --> 00:01:30,540
secretes thyroid hormone primarily in the four of what's called T4. 95% of what's secreted

00:01:30,540 --> 00:01:40,780
is in T4. 5% is in the active form of T3. Well, T4 will then convert to T3 in the gut and in the liver.

00:01:41,340 --> 00:01:48,140
So sometimes when a person does have low thyroid, technically low thyroid is defined by having

00:01:48,140 --> 00:01:59,740
low T3. So if a person has low free T3 and low total T3, then you would look at why? It can

00:01:59,740 --> 00:02:06,700
be because of a conversion problem. Maybe they have high or high normal T4. It's not converting

00:02:06,700 --> 00:02:12,460
to T3. Well, then you got to fix the person's gut and work on the person's liver. That can also

00:02:12,460 --> 00:02:20,540
give a person an elevated TSH. So again, you would give the person more thyroid hormone based upon

00:02:20,540 --> 00:02:28,300
elevated TSH alone. If the person had elevated TSH, low T3 and low T4, then they probably need

00:02:28,300 --> 00:02:37,980
an increase in their dose of thyroid medication. But if by just doing a blood test and showing TSH

00:02:38,060 --> 00:02:47,100
alone without running the rest of a full thyroid profile, again, I'm sorry, but this bothers me

00:02:47,100 --> 00:02:58,380
because this is bad practice. We'll just say bad practice. It's just wrong. It's not getting a good

00:02:58,380 --> 00:03:07,900
evaluation of what's going on. Sorry, but it's just not good. Dr. Reed,

00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:17,600
comment by a person, a person who asked this question. Our friend had the scanner

00:03:17,600 --> 00:03:24,080
brought it to our house and ran the test. I just apologize. I don't want to mean anything

00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:30,400
mean to your friend or anything, but I just don't think they're, they can be good for scanning

00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:39,680
to see, oh, maybe I should test them. Do a proper test like a blood test or a urine test, a laboratory.

00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:46,800
That's an accredited, clear, approved lab. It's hard to get that accreditation. And they're using

00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:55,040
proper machinery to run your tested. Then, then I would say, then you could use it for that purpose,

00:03:55,040 --> 00:04:01,600
but you don't diagnose off as I don't scan. You just don't. It's just not, that is, that is not

00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:09,920
correct. That's not right practice. As much as it's not right practice to diagnose on a T,

00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:17,440
a low thyroid on a TSH level. There's a lot of practitioners, maybe the majority of

00:04:17,440 --> 00:04:22,640
practitioners, medical doctors, and alternative practitioners that do not understand how to manage

00:04:22,640 --> 00:04:30,640
thyroid cases. I don't say that arrogantly. It's just, I've had a lot of training. It's

00:04:31,840 --> 00:04:39,120
been all my money going to school. But you kind of do it. If you want to do it, it's right for people.

00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:47,840
I just, I don't get it. I'm sorry.

